er work.\n  - writing gig: Joanna had an audition yesterday for a writing gig, feeling a mix of excitement and anxiety afterward. Nate previously encouraged her, noting her hard work and passion.\n  - screenplay: Joanna wrote parts of a screenplay that appeared on the big screen yesterday and submitted a recent screenplay to a film contest.\n  - work: Joanna, a writer, lost all her work progress when her laptop crashed last week. Nate expressed sympathy and suggested backing up work in the future.\n  - stories: Joanna finds happiness and fulfillment in creating stories and watching them come alive, calling writing a blessing for her.\n  - early writings: Joanna's early writings, found in old notebooks last week, include elements of self-discovery that movie producers found interesting.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1361,"context_chars":5593,"retrieval_duration":0.15584063529968262,"response_duration":6.030978679656982,"total_duration":6.186819314956665,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer provides an approximate duration of 4 to 5 months, which aligns with the gold answer of four months.","completeness_grade":"INSUFFICIENT","completeness_reasoning":"The context does not provide any specific information regarding the duration it took Joanna to finish writing her book. While it mentions that she finished writing her book, it does not specify the time frame or duration of the writing process, which is critical to answering the question. Therefore, the context lacks the necessary details to construct a complete answer.","missing_elements":["duration of time taken to write the book","specific start and end dates for writing the book"],"present_elements":["Joanna finished writing her book","Joanna recently started writing a book","Joanna possessed the story for a long time before writing it"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_3","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_3_qa_44","category":"2","difficulty":"unknown","query":"When did Na