y years passed between Audrey adopting Pixie and her other three dogs?","golden_answer":"three years","hypothesis":"Audrey adopted Pixie on April 2, 2023. She has owned her other three dogs (Panda, Pepper, and Precious) since March 27, 2020. \n\nTo calculate the time between these two events:\n\n1. From March 27, 2020, to March 27, 2023, is 3 years.\n2. From March 27, 2023, to April 2, 2023, is an additional 6 days.\n\nTherefore, the total time that passed between Audrey adopting Pixie and her other three dogs is 3 years and 6 days. \n\nIn terms of years, this is approximately 3 years. \n\nFinal Answer: 3 years.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Audrey has owned Panda for 3 years. (event_time: 2020-03-27T00:00:00Z)\n  - Audrey has owned Pepper for 3 years. (event_time: 2020-03-27T00:00:00Z)\n  - Audrey has owned Precious for 3 years. (event_time: 2020-03-27T00:00:00Z)\n  - Audrey adopted another puppy named Pixie as a surprise for Andrew. (event_time: 2023-04-02T14:42:00Z)\n  - Audrey's dogs are all 3 years old (event_time: 2023-07-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - Audrey has pets. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Andrew is asking Audrey how long she has had her dogs. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Pixie is a puppy. (event_time: 2023-04-02T14:42:00Z)\n  - Audrey has a dog. (event_time: 2023-10-13T16:22:00Z)\n  - Audrey has dogs that are special to her. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey spent most of her free time taking care of her four dogs and ensuring they are happy and healthy. (ev